Packages dc (directory digitalcredential), digitalcredential/issuerkey,
digitalcredential/issuermeta and digitalcredential/internal/safehttp are
written from scratch.

The test vector testdata/draft-ietf-oauth-sd-jwt-vc-19-A.1-figure24.txt is
copied from draft-ietf-oauth-sd-jwt-vc-19, Appendix A.1 (Figure 24).

Third-party code: none is copied into this module. It depends on module
github.com/pilacorp/go-credential-sdk/jose of this repository, and through it
on github.com/decred/dcrd/dcrec/secp256k1/v4 (ISC License).
